<title>UK: Scottish Media takes 55.4 pct of Grampian.</title>
<headline>Scottish Media takes 55.4 pct of Grampian.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Media Group Plc on Friday said it had received acceptances for around 55.4 pct of the issued share capital in Grampian Television Plc.</p>
<p>Scottish Media now has effective control of around 74.4 pct of Grampian shares as it had already agreed to acquire 19.0 pct of the share capital.</p>
<p>Scottish Media said its offer for Grampian shares will remain open until August 7.</p>
</text>
